  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of an eco-friendly water mobility testbed in the Mekong Delta region of Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing water pollution and greenhouse gases generated by internal combustion engines for water mobility and establishing a sustainable, eco-friendly water mobility ecosystem&#xC624;&#xC5FC;&#xBB3C;&#xC9C8; &#xBC30;&#xCD9C; &#xAC10;&#xC18C;(&#xAE30;&#xC874; &#xC218;&#xC0C1;&#xBAA8;&#xBE4C;&#xB9AC;&#xD2F0; &#xB300;&#xBE44; &#xBA54;&#xCF69;&#xAC15; &#xAE4C;&#xC774;&#xB791; &#xC218;&#xC0C1;&#xC2DC;&#xC7A5; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; CO2 &#xBC30;&#xCD9C;&#xB7C9; &#xC57D; 53%&#xAE4C;&#xC9C0; &#xAC10;&#xC18C;),&#xC720;&#xC9C0;&#xBCF4;&#xC218; &#xBC0F; &#xC5F0;&#xB8CC; &#xBE44;&#xC6A9; &#xAC10;&#xC18C;(&#xBA54;&#xCF69;&#xAC15; &#xC0BC;&#xAC01;&#xC8FC; &#xC218;&#xC0C1;&#xBCF4;&#xD2B8; &#xD65C;&#xC6A9; &#xC0C1;&#xAC70;&#xB798; &#xC885;&#xC0AC;&#xC790;&#xB4E4;&#xC758; &#xAE30;&#xC874; &#xC2DC;&#xC2A4;&#xD15C; &#xB300;&#xBE44; &#xC720;&#xC9C0;&#xBCF4;&#xC218; &#xBC0F; &#xC5F0;&#xB8CC; &#xBE44;&#xC6A9; 73% &#xC218;&#xC900; &#xAC10;&#xC18C;)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To replace gasoline internal combustion engines currently used in small boats with electric propulsion systems, and to establish battery charging infrastructure in order to prevent environmental pollution, reduce fuel costs, and promote the adoption of eco-friendly technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
